        ↓
Argo Rollouts creates and manages Blue/Green
        ↓
We test Preview
        ↓
Argo Rollouts promotes Green

So:

Helm defines what the Rollout should look like.
Argo CD delivers that Helm configuration from Git.
Argo Rollouts performs the actual Blue-Green process.

